= About Alice
Alice writes documents in YLang and publishes them with yami-node serve-dir.
:: How this page is served
  Each page is a .ylang file in sites/alice.
  All pages share sites/alice/default.ysl.
  Edit this file and press Reload; the node reads it again on each request.
> ynp://127.0.0.1:7301/home | Back to Alice's home
> ynp://127.0.0.1:7302/notes | Read Bob's notes about Alice's site
